            <div xml:id="m-f2477ec3-b49b-4425-b7aa-211ec574cde9">
              <lg xml:id="m-102a8d12-39bf-418e-814b-b79a1ab9d81f">
                <l xml:id="m-12c9c92c-4339-479e-a613-bc6e5d648ef1" facs="#m-36b200e8-23b4-46b9-9579-364c766ea3dc" label="text-like">Trinity Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-bafa73af-6f1b-42b2-85e5-793a5f796851" facs="#m-be4d0e88-0f0f-4d0d-a33e-514b00ae2263" label="ambiguous">913</l><l xml:id="m-647320ba-043c-4a1d-9ad6-e081c4be54d5" facs="#m-7395b123-4f51-45be-ada8-4b3e9519a974" label="lyrics-like">mini. Date, et dábitur vobis: mensú-Quid autem vides festúcam in óculo</l><l xml:id="m-1862337c-d66a-4650-a9ae-1cb17d3744f7" facs="#m-4af9d504-4424-4902-8a71-9479e53657db" label="lyrics-like">ram bonam, et confértam, et coagi-l fratris tui, trabem autem, quae in</l><l xml:id="m-70af2bae-8630-4929-8f04-ef576d49ffb2" facs="#m-888b39fa-8935-4868-82eb-edb2e786f980" label="lyrics-like">tátam, et supereffluéntem dabunt in lóculo tuo est, non consíderas? Aut</l><l xml:id="m-7ba2ad3e-1473-4a61-90b0-42def6687972" facs="#m-955dc6eb-a061-42e1-9868-a071b11dbd3b" label="lyrics-like">sinum vestrúm. Eádem quippe men¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e7fd860-24de-4686-b8b8-21cf86b99347" facs="#m-20b0f9d6-1d03-4151-9fc3-20bf91b3272c" label="lyrics-like">quómodo potes dicere fratri tuo</l><l xml:id="m-ef9f14f8-b427-4938-8cbe-b5caae0aae07" facs="#m-091dc76f-a5f5-4541-ae59-5e9528dba8a1" label="lyrics-like">súra, qua mensi fuéritis, remetiétur</l><l xml:id="m-91f02442-734c-4407-892f-6a9e8aeb69c1" facs="#m-47d4177a-a0f8-49ba-a169-6143391da9ce" label="lyrics-like">Frater, sine ejiciam festúcam de</l><l xml:id="m-0a5f07ed-8da0-4bf0-802e-6fc0a7967ed2" facs="#m-466b1bfb-8757-4d12-a477-5eb3937f9ab2" label="lyrics-like">vobis. Dicébat autem illis et simili¬</l><l xml:id="m-690ef693-a45b-46e0-8029-5399c878cb72" facs="#m-5d56f4e9-09b4-408f-ab91-110197276ad8" label="lyrics-like">lóculo tuo : ipse in óculo tuo trabem</l><l xml:id="m-e4049eba-2594-4152-8806-d4b7d58646ee" facs="#m-9ff72b38-e3f4-4f19-a9b7-1256d54b9aa7" label="lyrics-like">túdinem: Numquid potest caecus non videns? Hypócrita, éjice pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-de17bdf9-0831-4bfb-84e8-7b7d8ff5b01b" facs="#m-859a66d1-255f-41ca-9c68-c766dc1adfe7" label="lyrics-like">caecum dúcere? nonne ambo in fó¬</l><l xml:id="m-538315b2-2506-43c9-8884-e98d38684d81" facs="#m-32f5cc77-c124-4a4e-818e-71e06c0569d9" label="lyrics-like">mum trabem de óculo tuo: et tunc</l><l xml:id="m-02abe309-44cd-4686-a26e-85836a6c4ee5" facs="#m-7157c276-0e38-4aea-96ce-2ff8774ebd5c" label="ambiguous">veam cadunt? Non est discipulus</l><l xml:id="m-8bb0a869-e07d-4941-b8d5-7f82516047e7" facs="#m-038c1d72-a312-4af4-a551-03999bc990d3" label="lyrics-like">perspícies, ut edúcas festúcam de</l><l xml:id="m-b08f1d03-37fd-4e6b-8365-feddd819c9cb" facs="#m-e457e32e-c4de-400e-b33e-7494ea6c5f26" label="lyrics-like">super magístrum : perféctus autem óculo fratris tui.</l><l xml:id="m-42dddd89-0a5a-4781-9a12-e27cca993668" facs="#m-501cbdb9-1a47-4959-8351-93b5dd7070bb" label="ambiguous">omnis erit, si sit sicut magister ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-f736029e-2895-4a07-a5e3-ed5f932de45f" facs="#m-b90ffa2c-3693-42c7-bfc3-b3ff674d1917" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-b512de6e-5161-48cf-a028-a94ac7d45e3f" facs="#m-1b43275a-4f0b-41da-8368-0bd11a1e6ee6" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Glória láudis. p. 914.</l><l xml:id="m-a9caebe1-a4b7-42d3-a63f-2429372209b1" facs="#m-8bb2cc1b-080a-4f4d-8938-a3f2b2dd5900" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-19d5f701-d505-4b81-9309-7416eef4e4c8" facs="#m-6ab55df7-0d24-4528-93a2-3bb83b763072" label="ambiguous">2. Cor. 13. d.</l><l xml:id="m-1238d354-3e30-457f-9c59-1d1e1a3cfff8" facs="#m-830abc33-0de2-4838-892d-733c2e7463fd" label="lyrics-like">(Rátia Dómini nostri Jesu Chri-[nicátio Sancti Spíritus, “sit cum</l><l xml:id="m-d9f60843-c9c0-4696-9401-2fc0c4507d38" facs="#m-5f46087c-ebc3-4013-bf27-5f65d90e32ed" label="lyrics-like">(Y sti, t et cáritas Dei, et commu-lómnibus vobis. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-dbb6b0c2-03f6-450b-ba39-25e34defec47" facs="#m-bf6b01c6-b6af-4232-93bf-c818573e3da9" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-501ba7af-cfbf-496b-944b-bbc74d31d4a4" facs="#m-b2449a73-2969-461d-80ed-5e45f6ae89ba" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-5aad8a89-0609-44f1-bbeb-8f89b0b625f0" facs="#m-28207e05-0d85-4af6-a3c7-d3fba84ea8b0" label="lyrics-like">Enedíctus es Dómine" In firmamén-to caé-li.</l><l xml:id="m-1c671c7a-2213-4ef4-8b2b-1ff56b9f576b" facs="#m-40cb5ca3-b9dc-4ddc-bc11-9d15702877d4" label="lyrics-like">V. Et laudábi-lis et glo-ri-ósus in saécu-la. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-046ab6ce-fe43-4b9a-bb2b-fafda3e18106" facs="#m-90d5bdc5-915f-46c7-83be-5a62a724d116" label="lyrics-like">V. Vérbo Dómini caéli firmáti sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-9a553c59-1365-4846-ac8c-8a6448201927" facs="#m-37df3ffb-bc55-425e-93d4-e834323c5059" label="lyrics-like">K. Et Spíritu óris éjus, ómnis virtus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-fa3a0f1a-677a-4877-a848-e2e8b3ac228f" facs="#m-47298fe4-8dd3-4533-9e4b-bb777feae203" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-697db24a-6c69-493f-b5a7-93801a607834" facs="#m-8e62c198-2624-47de-af4d-626b916b6f72" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ex quo ómnia. p. 915.</l><l xml:id="m-b4aa8477-0a74-4539-b332-2f58c275c0d3" facs="#m-ce99e31f-1936-483d-85fe-36a5bfb9e93a" label="ambiguous">1. Joann. S. b.</l><l xml:id="m-1b37062c-5733-4c78-bd70-656ff694c528" facs="#m-60777886-8ec2-4cac-9bfa-90cf147a6237" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-a9bcc2ad-ab2c-41c9-b0d5-3a3d257c5ba8" facs="#m-3f0b881e-4605-414a-a788-c4ec50e5c288" label="lyrics-like">NRes sunt, qui testimónium dant Spíritus Sanctus:* et hi tres unum</l><l xml:id="m-a88540ad-f93a-4e48-b0e6-2f274cda923c" facs="#m-9eb3d5de-72a4-42a7-9acb-8cf2019ac583" label="ambiguous">I in caelo:t Pater, Verbum, et sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-3a1a8625-d6c7-45f3-b4c8-09bfee9360ff" facs="#m-cfaae024-b690-4de9-953b-66fa1bd0f4eb" label="ambiguous">short !</l><l xml:id="m-29b038ef-541b-41e1-9bfd-50a91bc4bdaa" facs="#m-536d9a7d-55ae-4999-af00-863ea7ad8ff7" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-00559086-0041-4816-9a7b-41349bc85217" facs="#m-40028eee-968f-4969-ba28-1d481af969bc" label="lyrics-like">Erbo Dómi-ni “Caé-li firmá-ti sunt. V. Et Spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-02751d72-8767-417a-ae81-a4b7d98e8918" facs="#m-bd0e2898-2e57-421a-9524-918502e491ab" label="lyrics-like">ri-tu ó-ris é-jus, ómnis vírtus e-ó-rum. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-37bf4a4d-c8e6-4f2b-b8e6-ddb5f5a8d4f4" facs="#m-66efc29a-7216-4769-a907-66dc577c4d95" label="lyrics-like">V. sit nómen Dómini benedictum.</l><l xml:id="m-ce2c80e5-1f6c-45cc-a120-368f2ae54ffc" facs="#m-62f53411-af0f-4640-80c5-e1d2d24c1bbd" label="lyrics-like">R. Ex hoc nunc, et usque in saéculum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>